FASTVC-BENCH-CORPUS:chromium-main-v1-943b94ae-1c74-4335-94fa-ceb4d277cea8
This directory contains test data for the Safari importer.  The files in
this directory were written by Safari v7.0.1 on OS X 10.9.0.  In the
future we may want to version this directory if the data formats change.

This directory is passed in to the test code as if it were ~/Library,
so the directory structure mimics that of the Library directory.